            "salience_rank": 0
          },
          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.9
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "text": "The authorities, acting as the grid management authority, declared a red alert over the Visayas region. This emergency response was a necessary grid stabilization measure after the failed power unit went offline, creating a significant loss of generation capacity that the power stations now struggled to cover.",
