            "salience_rank": 0
          },
          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.85
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "text": "The vulnerable energy suppliers left exposed—eleven generators—saw their capacity diminished by prolonged neglect of critical infrastructure. Dangerous heatwave stressing the vulnerable system drove demand pressure, exposing the grid's fragility. Officials, as protective authorities managing the crisis, worked to stabilize the power grid amidst this threat.",
          "source": {
            "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
            "fragments": [
              "why-1",
              "why-2",
              "how-1"
            ],
            "center": "who-3",
