          },
          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.78
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "text": "From the perspective of the Philippines grid operator, the duty to protect the grid's stability was paramount. After the unit's unexpected shutdown triggered a grid incident, the power system overseer declared a red alert for the Visayas region. This emergency response aimed to manage the thin operating margin caused by high demand, implementing grid stabilization measures to prevent a broader collapse.",
